[
  {
    "text": "Welcome to Keyrus AI Agents,",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.817,
    "segment": "slide1"
  },
  {
    "text": "inside Keyrus AI Studio.",
    "start": 1.817,
    "end": 3.735,
    "segment": "slide1"
  },
  {
    "text": "Three agents, one delivery lifecycle.",
    "start": 3.735,
    "end": 6.509,
    "segment": "slide2"
  },
  {
    "text": "From the first meeting to go-live \u2014",
    "start": 6.509,
    "end": 8.55,
    "segment": "slide2"
  },
  {
    "text": "powered by AI. Every agent supports a different phase",
    "start": 8.55,
    "end": 10.382,
    "segment": "slide2"
  },
  {
    "text": "of an Anaplan engagement,",
    "start": 10.382,
    "end": 13.822,
    "segment": "slide2"
  },
  {
    "text": "so the question is:",
    "start": 13.822,
    "end": 15.237,
    "segment": "slide2"
  },
  {
    "text": "what do you need to do right now?",
    "start": 15.237,
    "end": 17.067,
    "segment": "slide2"
  },
  {
    "text": "If you need to UNDERSTAND, you start with the Discovery Agent \u2014",
    "start": 17.067,
    "end": 20.637,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "it captures and structures client needs",
    "start": 20.637,
    "end": 24.572,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "from meetings and source files:",
    "start": 24.572,
    "end": 26.012,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "recapping meetings, capturing requirements,",
    "start": 26.012,
    "end": 27.597,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "cross-checking client inputs and building user stories.",
    "start": 27.597,
    "end": 32.664,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Once the needs are clear and",
    "start": 32.664,
    "end": 34.1,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "you need to DESIGN,",
    "start": 34.1,
    "end": 36.669,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "the Anaplan SA Co-Builder Agent turns",
    "start": 36.669,
    "end": 39.696,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "those requirements into an Anaplan design \u2014",
    "start": 39.696,
    "end": 41.478,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "creating the architecture,",
    "start": 41.478,
    "end": 43.701,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "defining modules and formulas,",
    "start": 43.701,
    "end": 45.589,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "working with an existing model and",
    "start": 45.589,
    "end": 48.124,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "helping you build directly in Anaplan.",
    "start": 48.124,
    "end": 50.239,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "And when the model is already",
    "start": 50.239,
    "end": 52.358,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "built and you need to EXPLAIN",
    "start": 52.358,
    "end": 55.17,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "or TEST it,",
    "start": 55.17,
    "end": 56.237,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "the Anaplan Model Knowledge Agent explains",
    "start": 56.237,
    "end": 58.733,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "and documents that build \u2014",
    "start": 58.733,
    "end": 60.585,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "explaining the UX and its functionality,",
    "start": 60.585,
    "end": 62.197,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "tracing the backend logic,",
    "start": 62.197,
    "end": 64.798,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "generating test scripts and producing KT",
    "start": 64.798,
    "end": 67.339,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "and client guides.",
    "start": 67.339,
    "end": 69.647,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "That last one is the most complete of the three \u2014",
    "start": 69.647,
    "end": 71.487,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "and it's the one we'll dive into now.",
    "start": 71.487,
    "end": 72.905,
    "segment": "slide3"
  },
  {
    "text": "So let's meet the Anaplan Model Knowledge Agent.",
    "start": 72.905,
    "end": 76.194,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "This agent sits on top of",
    "start": 76.194,
    "end": 77.654,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "an already-built Anaplan model and its interface.",
    "start": 77.654,
    "end": 81.646,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "It ingests the backend and UX",
    "start": 81.646,
    "end": 82.658,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "metadata just once,",
    "start": 82.658,
    "end": 86.576,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "and from there it answers functional",
    "start": 86.576,
    "end": 87.853,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "and technical questions and generates deliverables:",
    "start": 87.853,
    "end": 89.891,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "test scripts, client-facing user guides,",
    "start": 89.891,
    "end": 92.419,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "and knowledge transfer documents.",
    "start": 92.419,
    "end": 96.995,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "Use it whenever you need to",
    "start": 96.995,
    "end": 98.499,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "understand or document a model that's",
    "start": 98.499,
    "end": 99.981,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "already built \u2014 what a page does,",
    "start": 99.981,
    "end": 102.538,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "what's behind a button, which modules it uses,",
    "start": 102.538,
    "end": 105.486,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "or how data flows between modules and actions.",
    "start": 105.486,
    "end": 107.326,
    "segment": "slide4"
  },
  {
    "text": "Getting started is simple.",
    "start": 107.326,
    "end": 110.213,
    "segment": "mk1"
  },
  {
    "text": "You upload the six mandatory files together,",
    "start": 110.213,
    "end": 112.575,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "at the start of the conversation.",
    "start": 112.575,
    "end": 116.258,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "These files come from an extraction",
    "start": 116.258,
    "end": 119.076,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "script inside the QA app \u2014",
    "start": 119.076,
    "end": 120.552,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "which you'll find in the Tools",
    "start": 120.552,
    "end": 122.255,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "section of the platform. Once uploaded,",
    "start": 122.255,
    "end": 125.434,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "you never need to upload them again \u2014",
    "start": 125.434,
    "end": 127.557,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "the agent reuses them throughout the whole conversation.",
    "start": 127.557,
    "end": 130.769,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "Once uploaded the files, we ask it to generate the",
    "start": 130.769,
    "end": 132.569,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "test scripts for a UX or",
    "start": 132.569,
    "end": 135.963,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "a whole Anaplan category.",
    "start": 135.963,
    "end": 138.562,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "We are asked once whether there's",
    "start": 138.562,
    "end": 140.104,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "anything particular to consider and whether",
    "start": 140.104,
    "end": 141.206,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "to keep the default test types",
    "start": 141.206,
    "end": 143.587,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "or use others.",
    "start": 143.587,
    "end": 144.698,
    "segment": "video1_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "In seconds, it returns a downloadable Excel with",
    "start": 144.698,
    "end": 147.3,
    "segment": "video2_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "the test cases \u2014",
    "start": 147.3,
    "end": 149.285,
    "segment": "video2_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "and it keeps adding to that same file,",
    "start": 149.285,
    "end": 151.747,
    "segment": "video2_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "one category at a time.",
    "start": 151.747,
    "end": 153.237,
    "segment": "video2_test"
  },
  {
    "text": "It also answers questions about the",
    "start": 153.237,
    "end": 156.657,
    "segment": "video_query"
  },
  {
    "text": "model's global backend structure.",
    "start": 156.657,
    "end": 159.024,
    "segment": "video_query"
  },
  {
    "text": "We can ask which module is",
    "start": 159.024,
    "end": 160.488,
    "segment": "video_query"
  },
  {
    "text": "referenced the most in the model,",
    "start": 160.488,
    "end": 162.473,
    "segment": "video_query"
  },
  {
    "text": "what a specific module references or",
    "start": 162.473,
    "end": 165.686,
    "segment": "video_query"
  },
  {
    "text": "is referenced by,",
    "start": 165.686,
    "end": 167.889,
    "segment": "video_query"
  },
  {
    "text": "which actions touch a module,",
    "start": 167.889,
    "end": 169.321,
    "segment": "video_query"
  },
  {
    "text": "or where a module's data ultimately comes from,",
    "start": 169.321,
    "end": 171.642,
    "segment": "video_query"
  },
  {
    "text": "tracing both formulas and actions. Also,",
    "start": 171.642,
    "end": 174.716,
    "segment": "video_query"
  },
  {
    "text": "it can generate a dependent tree",
    "start": 174.716,
    "end": 176.574,
    "segment": "video_query"
  },
  {
    "text": "for module references and build a schema showing references in and out.",
    "start": 176.574,
    "end": 180.568,
    "segment": "video_query"
  },
  {
    "text": "And when it's time to document,",
    "start": 180.568,
    "end": 183.202,
    "segment": "video1_kt"
  },
  {
    "text": "we can ask it to generate",
    "start": 183.202,
    "end": 186.042,
    "segment": "video1_kt"
  },
  {
    "text": "a user guide for a section,",
    "start": 186.042,
    "end": 189.148,
    "segment": "video1_kt"
  },
  {
    "text": "or a full training document for",
    "start": 189.148,
    "end": 190.118,
    "segment": "video1_kt"
  },
  {
    "text": "the whole model.",
    "start": 190.118,
    "end": 191.706,
    "segment": "video1_kt"
  },
  {
    "text": "The agent generates a knowledge transfer",
    "start": 191.706,
    "end": 194.106,
    "segment": "video2_kt"
  },
  {
    "text": "document in Word format with a global architecture overview \u2014",
    "start": 194.106,
    "end": 196.963,
    "segment": "video2_kt"
  },
  {
    "text": "purpose, overall architecture, data flows, terminology, rules \u2014",
    "start": 196.963,
    "end": 202.322,
    "segment": "video2_kt"
  },
  {
    "text": "generated once per session,",
    "start": 202.322,
    "end": 203.696,
    "segment": "video2_kt"
  },
  {
    "text": "plus per-category sections naming the real",
    "start": 203.696,
    "end": 206.379,
    "segment": "video2_kt"
  },
  {
    "text": "backend modules and actions behind each page. And that's just part of it.",
    "start": 206.379,
    "end": 208.625,
    "segment": "video2_kt"
  },
  {
    "text": "The agent brings nine key capabilities:",
    "start": 208.625,
    "end": 211.149,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "module and page discovery,",
    "start": 211.149,
    "end": 213.76,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "functional and technical explanations,",
    "start": 213.76,
    "end": 214.959,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "test script generation and deep-dives,",
    "start": 214.959,
    "end": 216.901,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "user guides, knowledge transfer documents,",
    "start": 216.901,
    "end": 218.8,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "backend structure queries,",
    "start": 218.8,
    "end": 221.282,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "a fully interactive Q&A session,",
    "start": 221.282,
    "end": 224.177,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "and optional visual context from PDFs or images.",
    "start": 224.177,
    "end": 225.231,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "Inside the agent you'll also find",
    "start": 225.231,
    "end": 228.375,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "related prompts \u2014",
    "start": 228.375,
    "end": 231.132,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "suggestions designed for exactly what you're doing,",
    "start": 231.132,
    "end": 232.478,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "for every use case.",
    "start": 232.478,
    "end": 233.385,
    "segment": "slide5"
  },
  {
    "text": "Explain, test and document a complete Anaplan model \u2014",
    "start": 233.385,
    "end": 236.151,
    "segment": "closing"
  },
  {
    "text": "all in one agent,",
    "start": 236.151,
    "end": 237.45,
    "segment": "closing"
  },
  {
    "text": "with Anaplan Model Knowledge.",
    "start": 237.45,
    "end": 239.308,
    "segment": "closing"
  }
]